
mint sift
  case text
    slot value
  case link, mint link
    slot value
  case move, mint move
    slot value
  case read, mint read
    slot value
  case loan, mint loan
    slot value
  case make, mint make
    slot value
  case call, mint call
    slot value
  case task, mint task
    slot value
  case form, mint form
    slot value

mint link
  case road
    slot road
  hook make
    make link
      bind road, read road

mint move
  case road
    slot road
  hook make
    make move
      bind road, read road

mint read
  case road
    slot road
  hook make
    make read
      bind road, read road

mint loan
  case road
    slot road
  hook make
    make loan
      bind road, read road
